            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>To Imperator Antoninus Augustus Pius. Antonia Picentina, daughter of Gnaeus, [wife of] Gaius C[---] Secundus, praetorian officer and patron of the colony, sacerdos of diva
                   Faustina, who set up for Falerii the statues which were promised for the adornment of the theatre; and at the dedication she gave a distribution to the decurions and the urban populace.
                </p>
